<title>SINGAPORE: Keppel Corp rises on block deals.</title>
<headline>Keppel Corp rises on block deals.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diversified conglomerate Keppel Corp Ltd rallied in early Tuesday trade after a block deal of 424,000 shares between S$10.70 and S$10.80, dealers said.  </p>
<p>At 0125 GMT, the stock was trading at S$10.90, up 40 cents on 824,000 shares, including the block deals.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
